      "summary": "The Gothenburg Court of Appeal dismissed Elite Trading's appeal on the 11th of this month, following a request to withdraw the case made by Elite Trading Scandinavia's liquidator, who cited that a tobacco license is no longer needed since the company is going into liquidation. The Gothenburg Court of Appeal confirmed to Cigarrvärlden that the dismissal became legally binding on September 11th and is not subject to appeal.",
